			],
			"Message": "build(Cocoon): Regenerate RouteManifest timestamp\n\nThe RouteManifest generation timestamp was updated from 2026-06-10T15:20:08Z to 2026-06-10T15:20:42Z in the generated source file. Corresponding compiled artifacts in Target/Generated/ and the TypeScript build info (tsconfig.tsbuildinfo) were also refreshed as part of the regeneration cycle.\n\nThis is a routine build artifact update with no functional code changes.",
			"SHA": "e150dfdd48ded52c77dff5343aef38ea09242c90"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
			"Date": "2026-06-10T15:20:44Z",
